WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.961
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
And now, the moment you've

00:00:01.961 --> 00:00:04.578
all been waiting for.
Marvel Studios' Black Widow.

00:00:04.578 --> 00:00:06.328
Enjoy this special look.

00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:10.110
NATASHA ROMANOFF
I've lived a lot of lives.

00:00:10.742 --> 00:00:12.742
But I'm done
running from my past.

00:00:15.019 --> 00:00:16.159
I was an assassin.

00:00:17.043 --> 00:00:18.145
Spy.

00:00:18.145 --> 00:00:19.144
An Avenger.

00:00:20.169 --> 00:00:22.481
Before that,
I had a family.

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:27.069
NATASHA ROMANOFF
We have unfinished business.

00:00:27.623 --> 00:00:28.570
ALEXEI SHOSTAKOV
We fight with you.

00:00:38.988 --> 00:00:39.665
YELENA BELOVA
Ha!

00:00:42.199 --> 00:00:42.871
NATASHA ROMANOFF
You ok?

00:00:42.871 --> 00:00:43.669
YELENA BELOVA
Great plan.

00:00:45.572 --> 00:00:47.572
I love the part where
I almost bled to death.

